Z||000000||btoth||08-27-2001||09:43 AM||||NO!!!!!   First day of my 3rd year of college.... the years sure have gone by fast.  I woke up early today for my 8:00 class so that I could try to find parking on the street.  Well, it turns out that over the summer they put up a whole heck of a lot more "No Parking" signs.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>First class seems cool (astronomy), but we have those crappy small chairs with the half desk thing on the side.  Very unconfortable.  Whoever designed those desks should be shot. (J/K)<P>Now I'm sitting at home waiting to go to my next class at 10:40.  I have to try to find parking on the same street I parked on earlier... should be fun trying to find a spot.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  And then I have a night class... it's gonna be a <I>long</I> day.<P>Oh well... how many of you out there are starting back today??||||reg||6
Z||000001||Songman||08-27-2001||09:44 AM||||Just wait till you are looking at your 20 year class reunion! Where does the time go?!?<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||btoth||08-27-2001||01:02 PM||||Well... couldn't find my room for the 2nd class because they went and renumbered the <I>WHOLE</I> building since last semester.  (Why, I don't know.)  Then I came out of class to go to my car... and what do you know... a parking ticket! Yay!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  Aparrently the "no parking here to corner" implies not just to the corner, but the majority of the street.  Why put a "no parking here to corner" at the end of the street with the arrow pointing away from the nearest corner???  I hate this town!  And then, some $%#@ almost ran right into the side of my car so I hit the gas to get out of the way and now my car won't go into 3rd gear (auto).  *Sigh*  Off to a good start today.||||reg||13
