Z||000016||sqoach||08-27-2001||11:09 PM||||What's.....school...??? I'm retired!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>J/K. I'm a highschool graduate, and took 1 semester of college. 13 hours. Dropped 2 classes, passed one of the remaining two with an A  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I just hated it. Just as boring as highschool, but you don't go as often. It was easy to skip classes, so that's what I did. History I skipped the most because it was so damn boring.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_zz.gif"> We just go into class, take notes, and that's it. Had a test about every 3-4 weeks over 5 or 6 chapters!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> I sure as heck didn't (couldn't) learn anything, so I dropped it.<BR>I'll be starting an Auto Tech class in a couple weeks. Much more what I'm into, and wanting to learn. Then if I like it enough, I'll be going full time.<BR>But for now, I'm taking the easy life  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>I say have fun while you can. I mean what have you got to look forward to after highschool? Working the rest of your life so you can support yourself and have a decent place to live. Whoopee...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <P>84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR>86 SC (FOR SALE)<BR>86 SE V6 (new project)||||reg||1
Z||000017||turbo86se||08-27-2001||11:25 PM||||Tomorrow is my first day of school at Tech. This is my last semester before I graduate!!!!  YEAH!!!<BR>Tuesday's and Thursday's I have class from 8am -1:30, then back at 5:30-8:30. <BR>I'm taking Police Supervision (professor is Chief of Police in Surfside), Public Speaking, Computers 101, English 102, and Math 155. Oh I also intern with County Police too. Not to mention working 4 days a week. I won't have time for any kind of life. At least there is a big light at the end of the tunnel. And hopefully a Crown Victoria or Impala and a badge with my name on it!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||1
