Z||000019||Brandon86SE||08-28-2001||12:10 AM||||What's up with all this "back to school" talk, and whining?  I'm writing mid-terms this week!  I'm taking Electronics Engineering, and go YEAR-ROUND!!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  That means no 4 month summer breaks like you other college students.  Oh well, at least I'm done in only 3 years.  2 years and half a semester left!  hurrah!  Then I can afford to work on my car!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000020||FieroGT 914||08-28-2001||01:16 AM||||Unfortunately I started back at school last tuesday - it was the first day of my 5th (and last) year for mechanical engineering... <P>Brandon86SE: I almost would rather have gone year round to get it over with sooner.  I can't wait to be done too so I can start on modifying my 87GT too!<P>It sucks being away from my sweetheart too... I miss ya Jen  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> but at least we should get to go to the beach for labor day this weekend  and hopefully we'll get to meet up with Lisa (FieroLisa) and Ken (kslish) while we're down there!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Joe<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.worldlynx.net/asittingduck/FieroGT/Signature.jpg">   <BR>AOL I.M.: FieroGT 914<BR>White 86 1/2 GT (Stock)<BR>Maroon 87 GT (Mod)||||reg||1
Z||000021||Nashco||08-28-2001||03:39 AM||||Just starting??? Ha...wusses!  I'm at mid-term, started up after fourth of July.  I go to a school that is a cooperative education school (like having an internship).  We do school three months, then work three months, then school three months, then work three months...etc...you see the pattern.  So we get about a five weeks vacation over the entire year for Christmas and summer...<P>I wish I wasn't here...aahhh!!  Well, at least I only have five weeks left <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Then back to 'bama to work for Harley <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Yeah, school sucks, but work makes up for it!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
